Revision history for Perl extension PHP::Decode.

0.303 2025-09-04
	- fixed array_shift() for unresolved values
	- treat unset superglobals as unknown in array ref functions
	- fixed descending range() and step support
	- allow uppercase end keywords for alternative syntax
	- fixed else/elseif for alternative if syntax
	- include single newline in php script end tag
	- added perl license and github repository to META
	- added rpm spec file and make rpm target
	- require core Digest::SHA instead of Digest::SHA1

0.302 2023-05-23
	- fixed Redundant argument in sprintf warning
	- fixed "Experimental keys on scalar is now forbidden" perl-5.24 error
	- fix 64bit hex parsing for ivsize=4 (from cpan testers)
	- fix float precision test for nvsize=12 (from cpan testers)
	- use bignum instead of bigint for 64bit hex (from cpan testers)

0.301 2023-05-16
	- initial cpan release

